## External-Subject Compliance
✅ Valid: Measures coordination infrastructure reliability rather than self-cognition. Operator needs to know "when does communication break?" — this provides that signal without third-person constraint violations.

## Next Cycle Direction
Focus shifts from building additional probes toward **design review**: What instrumentation architecture actually achieves the sampling density operators need? Options include:
- Switching bb_perf_probe.py to event-based streaming instead of request-response polling
- Adding alert thresholds for automated operator notification on consecutive failures
- Correlating error events with cadence_analysis data to detect overload patterns

